WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.166 --> 00:00:33.041
With this twentieth verse of Chapter 15,

2
00:00:33.041 --> 00:00:36.500
Lord Krishna concludes the entire chapter.

3
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.291
He briefly explains the importance
of this knowledge,

4
00:00:38.291 --> 00:00:40.458
the worthiness required to receive it,

5
00:00:40.458 --> 00:00:45.250
and the fruit that comes from understanding it.

6
00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:51.750
In this verse, Lord Krishna

7
00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.916
uses the word guhyatamam –

8
00:00:54.916 --> 00:01:00.416
meaning ‘the most profound
and confidential knowledge.’

9
00:01:00.416 --> 00:01:03.208
This is not merely a hidden secret.

10
00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:06.500
It is a truth filled with depth and sanctity,

11
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.833
that only one

12
00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:12.458
who is truly worthy can receive.

13
00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:14.666
This is not surface information –

14
00:01:14.666 --> 00:01:18.083
it is the very heart of all Vedic knowledge.

15
00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:20.666
Why is it so confidential?

16
00:01:20.666 --> 00:01:24.083
Because it reveals the supreme truth –

17
00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:26.958
that Lord Krishna is the Purushottama,

18
00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:29.041
the Supreme Person.

19
00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:32.083
He is not merely beyond the bound jivatmas,

20
00:01:32.083 --> 00:01:34.708
not merely beyond the liberated souls –

21
00:01:34.708 --> 00:01:36.916
He is the foundation of all of them.

22
00:01:36.916 --> 00:01:41.666
And loving service to Him is the true path.

23
00:01:41.666 --> 00:01:45.333
Then comes the question – why is Arjun

24
00:01:45.333 --> 00:01:47.291
worthy of this knowledge?

25
00:01:47.291 --> 00:01:48.000
Lord Krishna

26
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.875
calls him anagha – meaning sinless.

27
00:01:52.875 --> 00:01:58.291
The sense is that Arjun is free
from envy and ego.

28
00:01:58.291 --> 00:02:00.250
And these are the very qualities

29
00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:03.208
that obstruct spiritual understanding.

30
00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:06.875
When the heart is pure, humble, and open,

31
00:02:06.875 --> 00:02:09.875
only then can this knowledge enter the heart.

32
00:02:09.875 --> 00:02:12.541
And one who accepts this knowledge,

33
00:02:12.541 --> 00:02:14.666
what happens to them?

34
00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:17.750
Lord Krishna says – ‘Etad buddhva

35
00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:21.583
buddhiman syat kritakrityash cha Bharata.’

36
00:02:21.583 --> 00:02:23.083
That is, such a person

37
00:02:23.083 --> 00:02:25.500
becomes truly wise

38
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:28.416
and attains in life all that

39
00:02:28.416 --> 00:02:31.041
human birth was meant for.

40
00:02:31.041 --> 00:02:32.333
This is remarkable.

41
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:35.083
How many of us keep wondering –

42
00:02:35.083 --> 00:02:37.416
‘What should I do with my life?

43
00:02:37.416 --> 00:02:39.041
What is my purpose?

44
00:02:39.041 --> 00:02:41.291
What is real success?’

45
00:02:41.291 --> 00:02:44.416
Here Lord Krishna gives a direct answer –

46
00:02:44.416 --> 00:02:47.958
‘Know Me as the Purushottama

47
00:02:47.958 --> 00:02:50.916
and serve Me with love.

48
00:02:50.916 --> 00:02:53.583
This will make you wise.

49
00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:58.916
This will give you fulfilment and true joy.’

50
00:02:58.916 --> 00:03:01.041
Kritakrityah means –

51
00:03:01.041 --> 00:03:04.666
‘nothing more needs to be done.’

52
00:03:04.666 --> 00:03:08.125
One who knows and lives this truth

53
00:03:08.125 --> 00:03:09.750
has truly fulfilled

54
00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.916
the purpose of life.

55
00:03:11.916 --> 00:03:16.083
Whether they are wealthy or poor, learned

56
00:03:16.083 --> 00:03:19.083
or ordinary – it does not matter.

57
00:03:19.083 --> 00:03:22.458
They have attained the highest success.

58
00:03:22.458 --> 00:03:24.458
One might say –

59
00:03:24.458 --> 00:03:26.958
‘But the Vedas speak of so many subjects –

60
00:03:26.958 --> 00:03:31.666
sacrifices, deities, practices, meditation?’

61
00:03:31.666 --> 00:03:33.250
Yes, they do.

62
00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:38.666
But Lord Krishna says – all of them
ultimately come to rest here – in Me.

63
00:03:38.666 --> 00:03:42.541
This is the final essence of all conclusions.

64
00:03:42.541 --> 00:03:46.208
So what should we do with this knowledge?

65
00:03:46.208 --> 00:03:48.541
Not only understand it –

66
00:03:48.541 --> 00:03:50.291
live it.

67
00:03:50.291 --> 00:03:54.083
Let it become the guide of the heart.

68
00:03:54.083 --> 00:03:56.458
Let it transform our actions

69
00:03:56.458 --> 00:03:58.166
and turn our lives

70
00:03:58.166 --> 00:04:01.166
toward love and service.

71
00:04:01.166 --> 00:04:05.333
This is the final verse of Purushottama Yoga.

72
00:04:05.333 --> 00:04:08.416
Lord Krishna began this chapter

73
00:04:08.416 --> 00:04:12.000
with the image of the world as an inverted tree,

74
00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.791
and has gradually led us –

75
00:04:14.791 --> 00:04:21.291
through detachment, discernment,
and spiritual vision – to stand here,

76
00:04:21.291 --> 00:04:24.708
where we can see Him not as a part

77
00:04:24.708 --> 00:04:26.125
of the world, but as its origin,

78
00:04:26.125 --> 00:04:27.291
its sustainer,

79
00:04:27.291 --> 00:04:30.541
and its ultimate goal.

80
00:04:30.541 --> 00:04:31.666
This is Lord Krishna’s

81
00:04:31.666 --> 00:04:35.583
loving invitation to all of us –

82
00:04:35.583 --> 00:04:39.250
‘Know Me, love Me,

83
00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:41.291
serve Me.

84
00:04:41.291 --> 00:04:45.166
This is the true fulfilment of life.’

85
00:04:49.458 --> 00:04:50.666
You can spend

86
00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:54.083
many years of life searching
for meaning, contentment,

87
00:04:54.083 --> 00:04:58.208
and completeness –

88
00:04:58.208 --> 00:05:01.500
sometimes in position and wealth,

89
00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:06.208
sometimes in relationships and
achievements, and sometimes

90
00:05:06.208 --> 00:05:09.958
on many paths of practice.

91
00:05:09.958 --> 00:05:14.083
But when you recognise Me

92
00:05:14.083 --> 00:05:18.291
as the Purushottama,

93
00:05:18.291 --> 00:05:22.500
this endless wandering stops,

94
00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.416
and the search finds its final home.

95
00:05:27.416 --> 00:05:32.166
Then life suddenly becomes simple.

96
00:05:32.166 --> 00:05:35.750
You are no longer scattered,

97
00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:39.250
no longer chasing hundreds of dreams.

98
00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:42.458
You clearly know

99
00:05:42.458 --> 00:05:47.208
what truly matters –

100
00:05:47.208 --> 00:05:50.375
love, service,

101
00:05:50.375 --> 00:05:52.791
and remembrance of Me.

102
00:05:52.791 --> 00:05:54.666
And in this clarity,

103
00:05:54.666 --> 00:05:57.666
peace comes on its own.

104
00:05:57.666 --> 00:06:01.166
True success is not measured

105
00:06:01.166 --> 00:06:03.750
by how much you have gathered –

106
00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.041
position, wealth, or praise.

107
00:06:06.041 --> 00:06:10.583
Success is measured by how deep

108
00:06:10.583 --> 00:06:13.541
your connection with Me is.

109
00:06:13.541 --> 00:06:17.458
When your heart becomes Mine,

110
00:06:17.458 --> 00:06:21.958
you have truly received everything –

111
00:06:21.958 --> 00:06:26.750
even if the world cannot see it.

112
00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:29.541
You do not need to become

113
00:06:29.541 --> 00:06:33.250
like anyone else to succeed.

114
00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:40.041
You only need to be what you truly are –

115
00:06:40.041 --> 00:06:41.791
a soul

116
00:06:41.791 --> 00:06:44.916
that has always been Mine.

117
00:06:44.916 --> 00:06:50.166
When you hold this truth in your heart,

118
00:06:50.166 --> 00:06:55.291
confusion fades, fear weakens,

119
00:06:55.291 --> 00:07:01.000
and love becomes the direction of your life.

120
00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.750
This is real knowledge.

121
00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.750
This is the true victory.

122
00:07:11.416 --> 00:07:15.250
The home is the greatest school –

123
00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:18.250
where you teach children etiquette,

124
00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:22.250
skills, and ambition,

125
00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.958
and can also show them

126
00:07:24.958 --> 00:07:28.208
the true purpose of life.

127
00:07:28.208 --> 00:07:31.958
But the greatest gift

128
00:07:31.958 --> 00:07:36.375
you can give them is

129
00:07:36.375 --> 00:07:39.500
spiritual clarity –

130
00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:44.041
the understanding that life’s real goal

131
00:07:44.041 --> 00:07:48.125
is to know Me and love Me.

132
00:07:48.125 --> 00:07:53.458
I have said – one who knows this truth

133
00:07:53.458 --> 00:07:56.000
becomes truly wise

134
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.166
and fulfilled.

135
00:07:58.166 --> 00:08:01.416
This is the development of true intelligence –

136
00:08:01.416 --> 00:08:04.250
not just the gathering of facts,

137
00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:08.500
but recognising where the heart

138
00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:12.000
finds rest and steadiness.

139
00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:16.333
When children grow up with this clarity,

140
00:08:16.333 --> 00:08:22.791
success or failure does not easily unsettle them.

141
00:08:22.791 --> 00:08:26.750
When family members remind each other

142
00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:31.625
of their eternal connection with Me,

143
00:08:31.625 --> 00:08:34.666
they rise above small arguments,

144
00:08:34.666 --> 00:08:39.000
fears, and endless running.

145
00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:45.583
Do not limit each other
to temporary achievements.

146
00:08:45.583 --> 00:08:48.541
Remind each other of that true home

147
00:08:48.541 --> 00:08:51.791
and final goal,

148
00:08:51.791 --> 00:08:56.000
where the soul finds peace.

149
00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.083
A family that

150
00:08:58.083 --> 00:09:01.833
stands on this spiritual foundation

151
00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:04.958
does not only survive in the world –

152
00:09:04.958 --> 00:09:08.208
it shines with strength, peace,

153
00:09:08.208 --> 00:09:12.083
and lasting joy.

154
00:09:12.083 --> 00:09:16.458
Because its roots are in what is truly

155
00:09:16.458 --> 00:09:19.000
eternal

156
00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.916
and truly matters.

157
00:09:25.416 --> 00:09:27.250
At the workplace

158
00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:31.083
you will face both victory

159
00:09:31.083 --> 00:09:34.041
and defeat –

160
00:09:34.041 --> 00:09:37.666
sometimes praise will come,
sometimes criticism.

161
00:09:37.666 --> 00:09:39.666
But one

162
00:09:39.666 --> 00:09:45.041
who knows Me as the Purushottama

163
00:09:45.041 --> 00:09:49.750
remains steady, wise,

164
00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:53.541
and content in every situation.

165
00:09:53.541 --> 00:09:56.375
The true fulfilment of work

166
00:09:56.375 --> 00:10:01.083
does not lie only in reaching targets.

167
00:10:01.083 --> 00:10:03.583
It lies in this –

168
00:10:03.583 --> 00:10:06.750
‘Why are you striving?’

169
00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:10.500
Is it service with excellence?

170
00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.875
And through it all,

171
00:10:12.875 --> 00:10:17.416
is your inner connection with Me intact?

172
00:10:17.416 --> 00:10:21.583
When your purpose goes beyond

173
00:10:21.583 --> 00:10:25.125
only promotions and rewards,

174
00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:27.791
the world’s victories and defeats

175
00:10:27.791 --> 00:10:30.541
can no longer shake you.

176
00:10:30.541 --> 00:10:34.291
You work with your whole heart,

177
00:10:34.291 --> 00:10:36.500
but your peace

178
00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:40.583
no longer depends on the results.

179
00:10:40.583 --> 00:10:43.791
Your strength begins to flow

180
00:10:43.791 --> 00:10:46.750
from a deeper, unwavering source.

181
00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.291
Yes, make progress.

182
00:10:49.291 --> 00:10:53.083
Yes, move forward with ambition. But

183
00:10:53.083 --> 00:10:55.375
always remember –

184
00:10:55.375 --> 00:10:59.125
true success is not only achievement.

185
00:10:59.125 --> 00:11:02.000
True success is –

186
00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.958
staying connected to Me.

187
00:11:04.958 --> 00:11:07.750
When you work with My remembrance

188
00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:11.333
and My support,

189
00:11:11.333 --> 00:11:16.291
every effort becomes meaningful.

190
00:11:16.291 --> 00:11:20.208
Every step – whether it takes you up or down –

191
00:11:20.208 --> 00:11:21.166
moves you

192
00:11:21.166 --> 00:11:25.875
toward that destination where
there is lasting peace

193
00:11:25.875 --> 00:11:29.166
and true joy.

194
00:11:29.166 --> 00:11:30.416
Reflect on this.
